SCOPE AND PROVENANCE

Machine-readable accessibility does not imply a more permissive license. Where a structured record exposes `license_url`, that field states the current effective reuse license for that record. Records marked as adapted from the MetalHatsCats CBT Toolkit retain source provenance and the applicable source-license reference.

The pinned MetalHatsCats CBT Toolkit source corpus is separately documented as CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 in `data/toolkit-source.json`. Third-party materials and external sources remain subject to their own terms and are not relicensed merely because CBT Cards links to or describes them.

